  "description": "Elevate your typography with high-end grandeur, opulent curves, and contemporary serif sophistication using Luxafy Wetysh! This modern luxury serif font blends elegant high-contrast strokes with ornate calligraphic swashes, dramatic drop terminals, and sweeping ligatures. Its romantic yet commanding silhouette brings an unforced sense of haute couture glamour to every header.\nIdeal for luxury brand logos, high-fashion magazine titles, boutique perfume packaging, upscale wine labels, wedding invitation suites, and aesthetic social media graphics!",
